   <description>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ampersand is an e-mobility company active in Kenya and Rwanda with a battery-swapping model focused on electric two-wheelers. Our mezzanine debt funding comes from the Climate Innovation Facility and will enable Ampersand to accelerate the deployment of electric motorcycles and its battery-swapping network across East Africa. Our investment supports the decarbonisation of the transport sector in Rwanda and Kenya through the deployment of electric two-wheeler (E2W) bikes and associated battery and charging infrastructure across the region. It will also support Ampersand in raising capital from commercial investors.</narrative>
   </description>
